* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
# The shipped config is written by the mod itself, through IniWriter, which
# emits CRLF. Left on the repo default of LF, a fresh checkout differs from the
# file the code produces - which the shipped-ini test compares byte for byte,
# and which the packager bakes into the launcher manifest's seed.
*.ini text eol=crlf
*.dll binary
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
